---
import FeatureCard from '../FeatureCard.astro';
---

<section class="features container">
  <div class="features__grid">
    <FeatureCard title="Collections & schema">
      <svg slot="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="8" ry="3" />
        <path d="M4 5v6c0 1.66 3.58 3 8 3s8-1.34 8-3V5" />
        <path d="M4 11v6c0 1.66 3.58 3 8 3s8-1.34 8-3v-6" />
      </svg>
      Typed fields with validation; schema migrations run on startup.
    </FeatureCard>

    <FeatureCard title="Auth + OAuth2">
      <svg slot="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <rect x="4" y="10" width="16" height="11" rx="2" />
        <path d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3" />
        <circle cx="12" cy="15.5" r="1.4" />
      </svg>
      argon2id passwords, JWT tokens, OAuth2 with PKCE and account linking.
    </FeatureCard>

    <FeatureCard title="Realtime">
      <svg slot="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M5 12a7 7 0 0 1 14 0" />
        <path d="M8 12a4 4 0 0 1 8 0" />
        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.5" />
        <path d="M12 13.5V21" />
      </svg>
      Subscribe to record changes over WebSocket.
    </FeatureCard>

    <FeatureCard title="File storage">
      <svg slot="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M14 3H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9z" />
        <path d="M14 3v6h6" />
        <path d="M9 14h6M9 17h4" />
      </svg>
      Local (pluggable) file storage with short-lived file-access tokens.
    </FeatureCard>

    <FeatureCard title="Single static binary">
      <svg slot="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2" />
        <path d="M7 9l3 3-3 3" />
        <path d="M13 15h4" />
      </svg>
      One SQLite-backed executable — no runtime dependencies.
    </FeatureCard>

    <FeatureCard title="Embeddable Zig framework">
      <svg slot="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M13 2 4 14h6l-1 8 9-12h-6z" />
      </svg>
      Comptime hooks, custom routes, scheduled jobs, and plugins.
    </FeatureCard>

    <FeatureCard title="Static file serving">
      <svg slot="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="14" rx="2" />
        <path d="M3 8h18" />
        <path d="M8 21h8M12 17v4" />
      </svg>
      Ship your frontend from the same binary — point a flag at a folder, or embed it at compile time.
    </FeatureCard>

    <FeatureCard title="Typed TypeScript SDK">
      <svg slot="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M4 6h16M4 12h10M4 18h7" />
        <path d="M16 16l3 3 5-6" transform="translate(-2 -3)" />
      </svg>
      Generate a fully-typed client from your Zig schema — or from any running instance with <code>npx @zigbase/typegen</code>. Records, realtime, files, and typed custom-route RPC.
    </FeatureCard>

    <FeatureCard title="Session management">
      <svg slot="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4" />
        <path d="M4 20c0-4 3.6-7 8-7s8 3 8 7" />
        <path d="M17 14l2 2 4-3" transform="translate(-3 0)" />
      </svg>
      Revoke all sessions instantly via epoch rotation. Optional per-device session table: list active sessions, revoke one device, or log out everywhere.
    </FeatureCard>

    <FeatureCard title="Rate limiting">
      <svg slot="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" />
        <path d="M12 7v5l3 3" />
      </svg>
      Global rate limiter plus per-auth-method limits configurable at comptime or at runtime via <code>ctx.rateLimit()</code>.
    </FeatureCard>

    <FeatureCard title="Field encryption">
      <svg slot="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <rect x="4" y="10" width="16" height="11" rx="2" />
        <path d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3" />
        <path d="M12 15v2" />
      </svg>
      Mark any text/JSON field <code>encrypted</code> for transparent AES-256-GCM at rest. Rotate keys live with <code>zigbase rewrap</code> — no downtime.
    </FeatureCard>

    <FeatureCard title="TTL & KV store">
      <svg slot="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M3 6h18M3 12h18M3 18h18" />
        <circle cx="19" cy="6" r="2" fill="currentColor" />
      </svg>
      Auto-expiring records via <code>.ttl_field</code> (GC'd every 5 min). Built-in KV store for feature flags and settings, surfaced in the admin UI.
    </FeatureCard>

    <FeatureCard title="Auth lifecycle hooks">
      <svg slot="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M12 2l3 7h7l-5.5 4 2 7L12 16l-6.5 4 2-7L2 9h7z" />
      </svg>
      Magic-link, OTP, and WebAuthn passkeys. Hook <code>beforeAuthSuccess</code> and <code>beforeRegister</code> to gate logins, seed fields, and claim anonymous data — transactionally with the session.
    </FeatureCard>

    <FeatureCard title="Ctx capability layer">
      <svg slot="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <rect x="3" y="3" width="8" height="8" rx="1" />
        <rect x="13" y="3" width="8" height="8" rx="1" />
        <rect x="3" y="13" width="8" height="8" rx="1" />
        <rect x="13" y="13" width="8" height="8" rx="1" />
      </svg>
      A single <code>*Ctx</code> handed to every hook, route, and job — wraps records, auth, KV, flags, outbound HTTP, and atomic transactions. Connection pooling handled for you.
    </FeatureCard>

    <FeatureCard title="Deterministic testing">
      <svg slot="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M9 3H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4m6-6h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4M9 3v18m0 0h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9M9 21H5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2V9m0 0h18" />
      </svg>
      Freeze time with <code>ZIGBASE_FAKE_NOW</code>, fix randomness with <code>ZIGBASE_FAKE_SEED</code>, and capture outbound mail in test suites — all gated off in production builds.
    </FeatureCard>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .features {
    padding-block: var(--space-8);
  }

  .features__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(16rem, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }
</style>
